      "text": "What i want in v2 : \n1.) controller in between and Repository \n2.) strategy for url shortening interface \n3.) because thing is read heavy and things are more focus toward availablity then consistancy \nso, I will need replication of data where one will write and it will async way it will update the data in replication \nthat will be for only read \n",
